  "Booting clients can wait a moment to open the app; connected clients are actively chatting and cannot be dropped.\n\n“Boot rate limit (added during the incident)” only limits boot queries. Set its “Limit per second” low enough to let the database escape the loop and refill the cache, but high enough that at least 20% of booting clients still get in.": "啟動中的客戶端可以稍微等一下再打開 App；已連上的客戶端正在聊天，不能被中斷。\n\n「boot 限流（事故中加上）」只限制 boot 查詢。把它的「每秒上限」調低到能讓資料庫脫離惡性循環並補滿快取，但又不能太低，至少要讓 20% 啟動中的客戶端成功進入。",
  "Both customers lose the same share because they share one quota (\"All share one\"). The large customer drains the tokens the small customer needs.": "兩個客戶損失的比例一樣，因為它們共用一份額度（「全部共用一個」），大客戶把小客戶需要的令牌都用光了。",
