  "Cache stampede": "快取擊穿",
  "Cache stampede (hot key expires)": "快取擊穿（熱門 key 過期）",
  "Cache stampede. Split brain. A bad config push. Run them. Change them.": "快取擊穿、腦裂、壞設定推送。每一個都能跑，都能改。",
  "Cache-aside: the API reads Redis first; on a miss it reads Postgres and writes the value back to Redis. TTL is 10 s. The hottest key gets about 1,000 reads per second, and a Postgres query takes 100 ms with only 16 connections. When the hot key expires, every read in the 100 ms the DB query takes is a miss, so over a hundred requests read the same row at once. The DB queues, the API fills up, and about 7% of requests fail. Compare with the \"Cache lease + TTL jitter\" example.": "cache-aside：API 先查 Redis，沒命中才查 Postgres，再寫回 Redis。TTL 10 秒。最熱門的 key 每秒約 1,000 次讀取，Postgres 查一次要 100 ms、只有 16 個連線。熱門 key 一過期，查 DB 的 100 ms 內所有讀取都沒命中，上百個請求一起去查同一筆資料，DB 排隊、API 跟著滿載，約 7% 的請求失敗。對照「快取 lease＋TTL jitter」範例。",
  "Cache@@term": "快取",
  "Cached data cannot stay in memory forever, because the original data in the database can change. To keep answers fresh, caches give each item a TTL (time to live) — an expiration timer, like a \"best before\" date on milk. Once the timer runs out, the next read misses and fetches a fresh copy from the database.\n\nIn this design, the API uses cache-aside: it checks Redis first, and on a miss it reads Postgres and writes the fresh value back to Redis. When a very popular key expires, trouble starts. Every read of that key misses while the first database lookup is still running, so dozens of requests rush Postgres for the exact same row at once. That sudden flood is called a cache stampede (or thundering herd).\n\nHere, users send 3000 reads a second, and the hottest key gets about 1000 reads a second. Values live for a 10-second TTL in Redis. Postgres has 16 connections, and each read takes 100 ms. Guess what happens each time that hot key expires, then press Run.": "快取裡的資料不能永遠留著，因為資料庫裡的原始資料隨時可能變動。為了保持資料夠新，快取會幫每筆資料設一個 TTL（有效時間），就像牛奶的保存期限。時間一到，下一次讀取就會未命中，改去資料庫抓最新版本。\n\n這個設計採用旁路快取（cache-aside）：API 先查 Redis，沒命中才去查 Postgres，再把新值寫回 Redis。當非常熱門的 key 過期時，麻煩就來了。第一個查詢還在讀資料庫的期間，所有讀這個 key 的請求都會未命中，數十個請求同時衝向 Postgres 查同一筆資料。這波瞬間湧入就叫「快取擊穿」（也稱驚群效應）。\n\n這裡使用者每秒送出 3000 次讀取，最熱門的 key 每秒約有 1000 次讀取。資料在 Redis 裡存活 10 秒（TTL）。Postgres 有 16 條連線，每次讀取花 100 ms。先猜每次這個熱門 key 過期會發生什麼事，再按「執行」。",
  "Caching": "快取",
  "Caching and data": "快取與資料",
  "Calculate database load from the hit ratio": "從命中率算出資料庫的負載",
  "Calculate server utilization from arrival rate, slots, and service time": "從到達率、同時處理數和服務時間算出伺服器使用率",
  "Calculate the connections your writes need: writes per second × write time in seconds. Only the primary database handles writes, so give it more connections.\n\nAdding more API servers will not help because they still wait on the database. To stay within budget and complexity limits, remove or shrink a part that no longer earns its cost.": "算一下寫入需要幾條連線：每秒寫入數 × 每筆寫入秒數。只有主資料庫能處理寫入，所以要加多它的連線數。\n\n多加 API 伺服器沒用，因為它們一樣得等資料庫。為了守住預算和複雜度上限，把不再值得留著的元件拿掉或縮小。",
  "Calculate the worker slots the spike needs: arrival rate × job time. During the spike, about 180 jobs/s × 0.05 s ≈ 9 slots.\n\nWith fewer than 9 slots, a backlog builds up and slows async p99. With 9 or 10 slots, the worker keeps up. Change “Instances” or “Concurrency per instance” on the Thumbnail worker.": "算一下尖峰需要幾個 worker 槽：到達速率 × 單件工作時間。尖峰時大約是 180 件/秒 × 0.05 秒 ≈ 9 個槽。\n\n少於 9 個槽，待辦就會堆積並拖慢非同步 p99；有 9 或 10 個槽，worker 就跟得上。調整縮圖 worker 的「實例數」或「每台同時處理數」。",
  "Call": "呼叫",
  "Call {from} → {to} {what}: {before} → {after}": "呼叫 {from} → {to} 的{what}：{before} → {after}",
  "Calls per second": "每秒呼叫",
  "Calls that failed at once because the caller's concurrent-call slots were full": "呼叫端同時呼叫的名額滿了，直接失敗的呼叫",
  "Calls that first did the TCP + TLS handshakes; the other calls reused an open connection": "要先做 TCP＋TLS 握手的呼叫數；其他呼叫重用留著的連線",
  "Calls that time out are retried. Retries make the queues longer, so more calls time out, and that makes more retries. This is a positive feedback loop.": "逾時的呼叫被重試；重試讓排隊更長、更多呼叫逾時，又產生更多重試。這是正回饋。",
  "Calls the caller rejected locally and did not send, because few recent calls succeeded": "呼叫端看到下游最近很少成功，自己在本地擋掉、沒有送出的呼叫",
