  "Collapse": "收合",
  "Collapse {n} instances": "收合 {n} 台實例",
  "Combine fast cutoff (timeout or bulkhead) with a backup answer (fallback)—neither works alone.": "把快速止損（逾時或隔艙）和備用答案（降級回應）搭配使用——只用其中一個都不夠。",
