  "Connection \"{id}\" goes to a cache: when the cache misses or fails, the request already reads the database, so a fallback has no effect.": "連線「{id}」通往快取：快取查不到或故障時本來就會去讀資料庫，降級回應不會作用。",
  "Connection \"{id}\" starts at a queue: the queue hands messages to the worker and ignores this connection's timeout, retries, adaptive throttling, bulkhead, fallback and hedged requests.": "連線「{id}」從佇列出發：佇列把訊息交給 worker，不看這條線的逾時、重試、自適應限流、隔艙、降級回應和對沖請求。",
  "Connection pools through RDS Proxy add up to more than the proxy limit: {formula} = {total} > {limit}.": "經過 RDS Proxy 的連線池加總超過 Proxy 上限：{formula} = {total} > {limit}。",
  "Connection pools through RDS Proxy may add up to more than the proxy limit: {formula} = {total} > {limit} (estimated after the OS reserve; {high} with all memory).": "經過 RDS Proxy 的連線池加總可能超過 Proxy 上限：{formula} = {total} > {limit}（扣掉 OS 保留後的估計；用全部記憶體算是 {high}）。",
  "Connection reuse (keep-alive)": "連線重用（keep-alive）",
  "Connection setup": "建立連線",
  "Connection “{id}” was removed": "連線「{id}」被刪掉了",
  "Connection “{id}”: K is {k}": "連線「{id}」：K 是 {k}",
  "Connections changed from {a} to {b}": "連線數從 {a} 改成 {b}",
  "Connections needed = writes per second × seconds per write.": "所需連線數 = 每秒寫入數 × 每次寫入秒數。",
  "Connections needed: 2450 writes/s × 0.008 s ≈ 20": "所需連線數：2450 寫入/秒 × 0.008 秒 ≈ 20",
  "Connections {id}: {n} new connections opened ({k} calls; the others reused an open connection)": "連線 {id}：新開 {n} 條連線（呼叫 {k} 次；其他的重用留著的連線）",
  "Constraint problem": "限制題",
  "Constraint problems": "限制條件題目",
  "Constraints: 4000 per second": "限制：每秒 4000",
