  "Contribute": "參與貢獻",
  "Control plane (metrics, coordination)": "控制面（監控、協調）",
  "Control plane and bootstrap dependencies": "控制面和開機依賴",
  "Control plane {id}: blind, did not act {n} times": "控制面 {id}：看不到監控、沒有動作 {n} 次",
  "Controlled Delay—a rule checked when pulling a request from the queue that drops stale requests early (using the target wait once the queue stays non-empty for 100 ms) so servers do not waste slots on them.": "Controlled Delay（受控延遲）——從佇列取出請求準備處理時進行檢查的規則；一旦佇列持續非空滿 100 ms，就改用設定的目標等待門檻，提前丟棄已經等太久的過期請求，避免伺服器浪費槽位處理它們。",
  "Controls queueing delay (CoDel, as Facebook does it). If the queue emptied in the last 100 ms, a request may wait at most 100 ms; if it has not (congestion), at most this long. A request over the limit is dropped when its turn comes (CoDel), so no work is wasted. Facebook uses 5 ms. 0 means off.": "控制排隊延遲（CoDel，Facebook 的做法）。排隊在最近 100 ms 內清空過：一個請求最多排 100 ms；一直沒清空（塞車）：最多排這麼久。超過的請求輪到時直接丟掉（CoDel），不做白工。Facebook 用 5 ms。0 表示不用。",
  "Copied": "已複製",
  "Copies sent to shards or instances, over all calls. The target's load is the calls times this factor.": "每個呼叫同時送給幾個分片或實例，全部加起來的份數；終點的負載是呼叫數的這麼多倍",
  "Copy a link that opens this comparison": "複製一個連結，打開就是這組比較",
  "Copy a prompt for an AI": "複製給 AI 的提示",
  "Copy only the design JSON": "只複製設計 JSON",
  "Copy the design on the canvas as JSON, to give to an AI to change": "把畫布上的設計複製成 JSON，貼給 AI 修改",
  "Copy time": "複製時間",
  "Cost": "成本",
  "Cost and complexity in detail": "成本和複雜度明細",
  "Cost per month": "每月成本",
  "Cost ≤ {v}/mo": "成本 ≤ {v}/月",
  "Count the instances first. The peak is 900 requests per second × 20 ms each = 18 in progress at one time. Each instance handles 8 at a time, so you need 3 instances, not 6. Autoscaling does not help here: a new machine takes 2 minutes to start and the peak lasts 2 minutes, so the machines are ready when the peak is over, and autoscaling costs 1 more complexity point. 3 fixed instances are enough.": "先算要幾台。尖峰每秒 900 個請求 × 每個 20 ms = 同時有 18 個在處理；每台同時處理 8 個，所以要 3 台，不是 6 台。自動擴充在這裡幫不上忙：新機器開機要 2 分鐘，尖峰也只有 2 分鐘，機器好了尖峰已經過了，還多 1 點複雜度。固定開 3 台就夠。",
