  "Data is split over several shards by the hash of the key, and each shard is a primary plus replicas. A hot key makes one shard extra busy (hot spot).": "資料依 key 的雜湊分到多個分片，每個分片是一組主庫加副本。熱門 key 會讓某個分片特別忙（熱點）。",
  "Data is stored in a database": "資料有存進資料庫",
