  "Failure detection is too slow: Route 53 check interval {interval} s × {threshold} failures in a row = {total} s > 90 s.": "偵測故障太慢：Route 53 檢查間隔 {interval} 秒 × 連續失敗 {threshold} 次 = {total} 秒 > 90 秒。",
