  "Failures stop within a minute: new servers came up quickly here (short boot time and frequent checks), or there was already enough spare headroom before the surge.": "一分鐘內就停止失敗：這裡新伺服器開得夠快（開機短且偵測勤），或是突波前就已經留了足夠的餘裕。",
