  "Few fail, but p99 goes over 1 s": "失敗很少，但 p99 超過 1 秒",
  "Few fail, but p99 goes over 1 s: the design is sitting right at its ceiling, where queues grow long but still drain.": "失敗很少但 p99 超過 1 秒：設計剛好踩在上限邊緣，佇列排得很長但勉強還能消化。",
  "Few fail: this design has enough capacity to absorb the overload.": "很少失敗：這個設計有足夠容量撐過這波過載。",
  "Few reads are stale because the replicas are only a few milliseconds behind, so a read rarely lands inside the lag window.": "很少讀到舊資料，因為副本只落後幾毫秒，讀取很少剛好落在延遲時間窗內。",
  "Few requests got the fallback because recommendations were rarely cut off. Check that the API servers still hold up during the slowdown.": "很少請求拿到備用清單，因為推薦很少被切斷。確認一下推薦變慢時 API 伺服器還撐不撐得住。",
  "Fewer requests failed than the slow instance’s full share because something removed it for part of the time (such as a deep health check or temporary ejections).": "失敗比例少於慢實例分到的全部流量，因為有某個機制在部分時間把它移除了（例如深度健康檢查或暫時剔除）。",
  "Fewer than 10": "不到 10 個",
  "Fewer than 10 in 100 requests reach the database because the cache caught more than 90% of reads. Check whether this design has a very high hit ratio or uses a fixed hit rate.": "每 100 個請求不到 10 個進到資料庫，因為快取接住了超過九成的讀取。確認一下這個設計是真的命中率很高，還是切到了固定命中率。",
  "Fewer than 10% extra calls from hedging": "對沖多出的呼叫少於 10%",
