  "Finding a phone number on a sticky note on your desk instead of walking to the filing cabinet.": "直接在桌上的便利貼找到電話號碼，不用起身走到檔案櫃。",
  "Findings": "發現",
  "Finish": "完成",
  "First in, first out (FIFO)": "先來先做（FIFO）",
  "First, a retry budget caps retries at a share of normal calls—here, at most 10% of first-try calls over the last 10 seconds. It is like allowing at most 10 redials for every 100 normal phone calls.\n\nSecond, adaptive throttling works at the caller before a call is even sent. The caller counts calls sent and calls that succeeded over the last 10 seconds. When successes drop below a share controlled by K (here K = 2, meaning it starts rejecting when fewer than half succeed), the caller rejects some new calls locally.\n\nGuess how each limit performs, then run both.": "第一種是「重試預算」，把重試上限設為正常呼叫的一小部分——這裡是最近 10 秒第一次呼叫的 10%。就像每打 100 通正常電話，最多只允許 10 次重撥。\n\n第二種是「自適應限流」，在呼叫端送出請求前就先攔截。呼叫端統計最近 10 秒送出與成功的次數；一旦成功比例掉到 K 決定的門檻以下（這裡 K = 2，代表成功不到一半就開始攔），呼叫端會自己直接拒絕一部分新呼叫。\n\n先猜這兩種做法各有什麼效果，再分別執行看看。",
  "First-try calls in the spike: 3 × usual traffic": "突波期間第一次呼叫：平常流量的 3 倍",
  "Fix it": "修好它",
  "Fix it on the canvas (+{n} points)": "在畫布上修（+{n} 分）",
  "Fixed (cv 0)": "固定（cv 0）",
  "Fixed +{n}": "修好了 +{n}",
  "Fixed hit rate": "固定命中率",
  "Fixed!": "修好了！",
  "Fixed. Down for {s} s.": "修好了。停機 {s} 秒。",
  "Fixed: each read is decided at random by the hit rate. LRU: it really remembers keys and evicts the least recently used one when full; it starts cold.": "固定：每次讀取依命中率隨機決定。LRU：真的記住 key，容量滿了淘汰最久沒用的；一開始是冷的。",
  "Flash crowd: traffic triples at minute 5 for 20 minutes": "Flash crowd：第 5 分鐘流量 3 倍，持續 20 分鐘",
