  "Folded into API Gateway: throttling, integration timeouts and backends are read from it.": "併入 API Gateway：讀節流、整合逾時和後端。",
  "Folded into DNS: the health check becomes the failure detection time.": "併入 DNS：健康檢查變成偵測故障的時間。",
