  "Good overload protection keeps retries for rare glitches without letting them flood a busy server.": "好的過載保護能保留重試來救偶發小錯，同時不讓它淹沒忙碌的伺服器。",
  "Good system design meets its SLO targets with the simplest, lowest-cost architecture that works.": "好的系統設計會用最簡潔、成本最低的架構，穩穩達成 SLO 目標。",
