  "Guessed": "猜的",
  "Guessed at import: {params} (set the real values in the settings panel)": "匯入時猜的值：{params}（在設定面板改成實際的值）",
  "Guessed values": "猜的值",
  "Guesses": "次數",
  "Guesses right: {n} of {all}": "猜對：{n}／{all}",
  "Guessing coffee shop wait times from the daily average while ignoring the morning rush hour.": "只看全天平均客流量來猜咖啡店要排多久，卻忽略早上的尖峰人潮。",
  "HAProxy (L7)": "HAProxy（L7）",
  "Half of the cache turns empty for 10 seconds, sending many more misses to the database. From second 45 to 70, can the database hold?": "一半的快取變空 10 秒，讓大量沒命中的讀取湧向資料庫。第 45 到 70 秒，資料庫撐得住嗎？",
  "Half the cache empty: ~30% + (70% ÷ 2) = 65% miss rate": "掉一半快取：約 30% + (70% ÷ 2) = 65% 未命中率",
  "Half-open probe": "試探中",
  "Handing diners a simple backup menu when the main kitchen is down.": "就像主廚房出狀況時，先遞給客人一份簡單的備用菜單。",
  "Handle the 1,800 requests/s spike using at most 5 API servers. Keep the error rate under 1% and p99 latency under 100 ms.": "用最多 5 台 API 伺服器撐過每秒 1,800 個請求的尖峰，讓錯誤率低於 1%、p99 延遲低於 100 ms。",
  "Handle the write-heavy traffic within your budget and solo-developer limits: at most 1% errors, p99 at most 200 ms, at most $2,450 a month, and at most 6 complexity points.\n\nKeep the speed settings of existing components as given.": "在預算與一人維護的限制下扛住高寫入流量：錯誤率最多 1%、p99 最多 200 ms、每月最多 $2,450、複雜度最多 6 點。\n\n現有元件的處理速度設定請維持原狀。",
  "Handle the “Overload” scenario (2,000 requests/s for 40 seconds) within the target—under 1% error rate and p99 under 1 s—using at most 5 API servers.": "在「過載」情境下（每秒 2,000 個請求持續 40 秒），用最多 5 台 API 伺服器達標：錯誤率低於 1%、p99 低於 1 秒。",
  "Handles requests, then calls downstream. It keeps its slot while it waits on downstream (like a thread pool), so a slow downstream also makes it queue. When it connects to both the cache and the DB, reads use cache-aside.": "處理請求，再呼叫下游。等下游時仍占著自己的位置（像 thread pool），所以下游變慢會連帶讓它排隊。同時連到 cache 和 DB 時，讀取走 cache-aside。",
  "Hanging up the phone after being left on hold for 5 minutes.": "打客服電話被轉進語音等候 5 分鐘後，失去耐心直接掛斷。",
  "Has an end": "有結束時間",
  "Hash": "雜湊（hash）",
  "Hashing spreads keys evenly across the shards, not requests.\n\nOne hot key receives far more traffic than the rest, and all of its requests go to the single shard that owns it. That shard runs near its limit while the others still have room to spare. A sharded database is only as strong as its hottest shard, not its average.": "雜湊平均分散的是 key，不是請求流量。\n\n某一個熱門 key 收到遠多於其他 key 的請求，而且全部都打到存它的那一片。那一個分片逼近滿載，其他分片卻還有餘裕。分片資料庫能撐多少，看的是最忙的那一片，不是看平均。",
  "Having 4 baristas behind the counter making 4 drinks in parallel.": "吧檯後面同時有 4 位咖啡師，一次平行沖 4 杯飲料。",
  "Headroom": "餘裕",
  "Headroom instead of speed": "用餘裕換速度",
  "Health check removals": "Health check 移出",
  "Health check {id}: took an instance out {n} times": "Health check {id}：移出實例 {n} 次",
  "Hedge won": "對沖先成功",
  "Hedged request": "對沖請求",
  "Hedged requests (cutting tail latency)": "Hedged requests（壓低長尾延遲）",
  "Hedged requests {id}: {n} extra copies sent ({k} succeeded before the original)": "對沖請求 {id}：多送 {n} 份（{k} 份比原本的先成功）",
  "Hedges sent": "對沖多送",
  "Hedging": "對沖請求（Hedging）",
  "Hedging cuts tail latency for reads, but creates real extra load: set the delay near normal p95 latency, not lower.": "對沖請求能壓低讀取的長尾延遲，但會產生真實的額外負載：等待時間設在正常 p95 延遲附近，不要設更低。",
  "Here is your brief: a URL shortener run by one person. Traffic is 3000 requests a second with a 99:1 read-to-write ratio (99% link clicks, 1% new links).\n\nRight now, Redis caches the hottest links, and the database has 8 connections (each write takes 8 ms) plus 1 read replica. The site works, but maintaining a read replica takes extra operational effort—pushing complexity past what one person can safely run. Press Run, then inspect the cost and complexity points in the Results tab.": "這是你的需求規格：一個人維護的短網址服務。流量為每秒 3000 個請求，讀寫比（read-to-write ratio）是 99:1（99% 是點短網址的讀取，1% 是建新網址的寫入）。\n\n目前 Redis 快取了最熱門的連結，資料庫有 8 條連線（每次寫入 8 ms）外加 1 個讀取副本。網站跑得動，但多顧一個讀取副本會增加維運負擔，讓複雜度超出一個人能安全承擔的上限。按「執行」，再到「結果」分頁看看成本與複雜度點數。",
  "Here the cache is the bottleneck: check its capacity and how many operations it handles at once.": "這裡的瓶頸是快取：檢查它的容量與一次能處理多少次操作。",
  "Here the cache is the busiest: it is the first component to give up as traffic grows.": "這裡最忙的是快取：流量變大時它會最先撐不住。",
  "Here the database is moderately busy because a larger share of requests is reaching Postgres instead of stopping at the cache.": "這裡資料庫算中等忙碌，因為較大比例的請求沒被快取擋住，直接到了 Postgres。",
  "Here the database is nearly full because too many reads or writes are landing directly on Postgres.": "這裡資料庫快滿載了，因為太多讀取或寫入直接落在 Postgres 上。",
  "Here the database is the bottleneck: the reads that miss the cache and all the writes land on it. Check its connections and read replicas.": "這裡的瓶頸是資料庫：沒命中快取的讀取和所有寫入都落在它身上。檢查它的連線數和讀副本。",
  "Here the database is the busiest: it is the first component to give up as traffic grows.": "這裡最忙的是資料庫：流量變大時它會最先撐不住。",
  "Here the load balancer is the bottleneck: it forwards every request, so check its own settings.": "這裡的瓶頸是負載平衡器：每個請求都經過它，看它自己的設定。",
  "Here the load balancer is the busiest: it is the first component to give up as traffic grows.": "這裡最忙的是負載平衡器：流量變大時它會最先撐不住。",
  "Hide each guess": "收起每次的紀錄",
