  "Link copied": "已複製連結",
  "LinkedIn style: the feed's retry death spiral (2018 load test)": "LinkedIn 風格：Feed 的重試死亡螺旋（2018 負載測試）",
  "Links dropped": "連結掉線",
  "Little’s Law": "Little 定律",
  "Little’s Law (L = λ × W) turns arrival rate and time inside into the average number of requests inside any queue.": "Little 定律（L = λ × W）能把到達率與停留時間，換算成任何佇列裡平均的請求數。",
  "Little’s Law (L = λ × W): both sides must use the same boundary’s long-run average": "Little 定律（L = λ × W）：公式兩邊必須使用同一邊界範圍的長期平均",
  "Little’s Law works for any boundary you draw, as long as L (average headcount) and W (average time) describe that exact same boundary over the long run.\n\nIf the boundary covers only the active slots, W is the 2.5 ms service time, giving 800 × 0.0025 = 2.0 busy slots out of 4 (50% utilization). If the boundary includes the waiting line too, W is queue wait plus active work (see Measured above), giving the total average requests inside the server.": "只要公式裡的 L（平均數量）和 W（平均時間）採用的是同一個邊界範圍的長期平均，Little 定律在任何邊界都成立。\n\n如果邊界只畫在「正在處理的槽」，W 就是 2.5 ms 的服務時間，算出 800 × 0.0025 = 平均 2.0 個忙碌槽（4 個槽的 50% 使用率）。如果邊界連排隊一起算進整個伺服器，W 就是排隊時間加上處理時間（見上方實測），得出伺服器內的長期平均總請求數。",
  "Little’s law and one server": "Little 定律和一台伺服器",
  "Liveness (is the process up?)": "存活檢查（只看程序在不在）",
  "Load balancer": "負載平衡器",
  "Load onto canvas": "載回畫布",
  "Load shedding": "主動卸載",
  "Load shedding by priority": "依優先順序丟棄負載",
  "Load test: traffic 1.25 times in seconds 20–50, and one storage node 10 times slower": "負載測試：第 20–50 秒流量 1.25 倍，同時一台儲存節點變慢 10 倍",
  "Load-shedding threshold (drop batch)": "降載門檻（丟 batch）",
