  "Location service": "位置服務",
  "Location updates (Dispatch, Node.js)": "位置更新（Dispatch，Node.js）",
  "Location updates: heavy writes need sharding (after Uber)": "位置更新：寫入量大只能靠分片（參考 Uber）",
  "Lock held after the write": "寫完後再握鎖",
  "Locks": "鎖",
  "Long tail (cv 2)": "長尾（cv 2）",
  "Longer than the work itself": "比處理時間本身還長",
  "Look": "外觀",
  "Lookup": "查詢",
  "Lookups reach the map provider": "查詢有送到地圖供應商",
  "Losing half the cache roughly doubles the reads hitting the database. The database needs about twice as many connections as it has.\n\nIts queue fills up, calls time out, and both the web app and clients retry—piling even more load onto the database. When a cache carries most of your reads, it acts as core capacity: losing it is like losing database machines.": "少了一半快取，打到資料庫的讀取量大約變成兩倍。資料庫需要的連線數大約是現有的兩倍。\n\n它的佇列迅速塞滿、請求逾時，接著網頁應用與客戶端都開始重試——把更多負載壓向資料庫。當快取扛下了大部分讀取，它就是核心容量的一部分：失去它就像直接少了幾台資料庫機器。",
  "Lost writes": "遺失的寫入",
  "Lower \"Adaptive throttling K\" to 1.5 on every connection and run again.\n\nIn the charts: does the caller reject earlier than with K = 2? Does it ever let go after the spike?": "把每條連線的「自適應限流 K」調降成 1.5 再執行一次。\n\n從圖表上看：呼叫端有比 K = 2 時更早開始攔截嗎？突波結束後它有放手嗎？",
  "Lower than the theory estimate": "比理論估計值還低",
  "MIT license. The examples are simplified models, not any company's real architecture.": "MIT 授權。範例是簡化的模型，不是任何公司真正的架構。",
  "Make baseline": "設為基準",
  "Make health_check.interval shorter or lower unhealthy_threshold.": "縮短 health_check.interval 或降低 unhealthy_threshold。",
  "Make the API → recs timeout short (for example 100 ms) and turn on the fallback: without recommendations, return the page without them.": "把 API → recs 的逾時調短（例如 100 ms），並打開降級回應：推薦拿不到就先回沒有推薦的頁面。",
  "Make the function timeout shorter than the caller's timeout.": "把函式的 timeout 設得比呼叫端的逾時短。",
  "Make the system recover within 5 seconds after the spike ends, without adding more machines.": "不加機器，讓系統在突波結束後 5 秒內恢復正常。",
  "Make this change in the simulator": "在模擬器裡做這個改動",
  "Many extra calls went out because the hedge delay is close to normal latency, causing healthy reads to trigger duplicate copies too.": "多送了大量呼叫，因為對沖等待時間太接近正常延遲，連健康的讀取都跟著送出第二份。",
  "Many messages were processed twice because the visibility timeout is close to the job time, so lots of jobs outlived it.": "許多訊息被處理了兩次，因為 Visibility timeout 跟工作時間差不多短，大量工作都超過了時限。",
  "Many writes, few reads, keys concentrated": "寫多讀少、key 很集中",
  "Map provider (outside)": "地圖供應商（外部）",
  "Max concurrent": "同時處理上限",
  "Max depth": "最大深度",
