  "Max replication lag": "副本延遲上限",
  "Max replication lag@@detail": "最大複製延遲",
  "Max requests that passed the limit and have no response yet.": "已經放行、還沒拿到回應的請求最多幾個。",
  "Max retries after a failure. Rate limits (429) and an open circuit breaker are not retried.": "失敗後最多再試幾次。限流（429）和保險絲跳開不重試。",
  "Measure the real ceiling with Find limit": "用「找上限」測出真正的容量天花板",
  "Measured": "實際量到",
  "Measured wait is a few times the theory estimate: for part of the run the API servers came close to full, creating short queues that the average hides.": "實際等待是理論估計值的幾倍：這場模擬裡有一段時間 API 伺服器接近滿載，形成平均值看不出來的短暫排隊。",
  "Measured wait is below the theory estimate: the formula assumes requests are spread at random, while the load balancer sends each request to the least busy server, so fewer requests wait.": "實際等待比理論估計值低：公式假設請求隨機分派，但負載平衡器會把每個請求送到最不忙的那台，所以排隊變少。",
  "Measured wait is close to the theory estimate: the API servers never ran out of room, so the average load tells the whole story.": "實際等待接近理論估計值：API 伺服器全程都有足夠空間，平均負載就能說明全貌。",
  "Measured wait or theory": "量到的等待和理論",
