  "Measurement window: {from}–{to} s (the start is warm-up). Simulated {n} events": "量測區間：{from}–{to} 秒（前面是暖機）。模擬了 {n} 個事件",
  "Median latency": "延遲中位數",
  "Meet the brief on the same traffic. Hit the SLOs (at most 1% errors, p99 at most 100 ms) while staying at or under $2,200 a month and 6 complexity points.\n\nKeep the speed settings of existing components as given.": "在相同流量下達成需求規格：滿足 SLO（錯誤率最多 1%、p99 最多 100 ms），同時把成本壓在每月 $2,200 以內、複雜度最多 6 點。\n\n現有元件的處理速度設定請維持原狀。",
  "Meet the error rate and p99 targets inside the budget and the complexity the team can look after. The targets are gates; once you pass, cheaper scores higher.": "在預算和團隊能顧的複雜度裡，達到失敗率和 p99 的目標。目標是門檻；過關後，越便宜分數越高。",
