  "Owning one simple bicycle vs maintaining a whole fleet of custom racing bikes by yourself.": "自己騎一台簡單的腳踏車，對比一個人保養一整支客製化賽車隊。",
  "PUT time": "PUT 時間",
  "Page: from 20 s, 30–40% of requests fail and p99 goes up to about 3 s.": "值班告警：第 20 秒起，三到四成的請求失敗，p99 升到約 3 秒。",
  "Page: from 20 s, about 10% of requests fail and p99 goes up a little.": "值班告警：第 20 秒起，大約一成的請求失敗，p99 小幅上升。",
  "Page: from 20 s, about 10% of requests fail and p99 goes up to about 750 ms.": "值班告警：第 20 秒起，大約一成的請求失敗，p99 升到約 750 ms。",
  "Page: from 20 s, about 14% of requests fail. Latency does not change.": "值班告警：第 20 秒起，大約 14% 的請求失敗。延遲沒變。",
  "Page: from 20 s, about a third of user requests fail. Latency does not change.": "值班告警：第 20 秒起，大約三分之一的使用者請求失敗。延遲沒變。",
  "Page: from 20 s, almost all requests fail, and it never recovers.": "值班告警：第 20 秒起，幾乎所有請求都失敗，之後一直沒有恢復。",
  "Page: from 20 s, most requests fail and p99 goes up to about 3 s.": "值班告警：第 20 秒起，大部分請求失敗，p99 升到約 3 秒。",
  "Page: from 20 s, p99 jumps from about 80 ms to about 450 ms. No failures.": "值班告警：第 20 秒起，p99 從約 80 ms 跳到約 450 ms。沒有失敗。",
  "Paged. Getting the data…": "收到告警，正在取得資料…",
