  "Pass down (like gRPC deadline)": "往下傳（像 gRPC deadline）",
  "Pass down: the request carries the time when the user gives up. Each hop waits only until then; a request that has expired is dropped in the queue, so no wasted work; no retries after it expires.": "往下傳：請求帶著「使用者放棄的時間點」。每一跳最多等到那時候；已經過期的請求在排隊時直接丟掉，不再白做；過期後也不再重試。",
