  "Passed!": "過關！",
  "Passed! Score {n}": "過關！得分 {n}",
  "Passing a request deadline down drops work nobody is waiting for, but only when the deadline is shorter than each step’s timeout.": "把請求截止時間往下傳可以丟掉沒人在等的工作，但前提是截止時間比每一步原本的逾時更短。",
  "Past about 85% busy, wait times grow much faster than traffic. Unpredictable work times push waits even higher.": "超過約 85% 忙碌後，等待時間的成長速度遠快過流量。處理時間越不穩定，等待還會更長。",
  "Past capacity, excess requests must fail; your queue rules decide who fails and how long they wait.": "超過容量後，多出來的請求一定會失敗；佇列規則決定是誰失敗、以及要等多久。",
  "Past the ceiling, throughput stops growing, queues fill up, and extra requests fail.": "超過上限後，吞吐量不再增加，佇列很快塞滿，多餘的請求全部失敗。",
