  "Permanent storage on disk where a website safely saves and searches all of its data.": "放在硬碟裡的永久儲存空間，讓網站安全保存並查詢所有資料。",
  "Pick an answer, then press Run. The answer shows when the run ends.": "選一個答案，再按「執行」。跑完就揭曉。",
