  "Pick one to start: it loads on the canvas, and its goals show at the top right of the canvas.": "選一題開始：題目會載入畫布，目標顯示在畫布右上角。",
  "Pick the Terraform plan as JSON, not a .tf source file. In your Terraform folder, run:": "要選的是 Terraform plan 的 JSON，不是 .tf 原始檔。在你的 Terraform 資料夾執行：",
