  "Pin: new versions will not push it out": "釘選：不會被新的版本擠掉",
  "Plan for 70–80% utilization at peak, never 100%.": "尖峰容量規劃請抓 70–80% 使用率，絕不要抓 100%。",
  "Plan format version {version} is not supported. Only 1.x is supported.": "不支援的 plan 格式版本 {version}，只支援 1.x。",
  "Playback speed": "播放速度",
  "Poison message ratio": "毒訊息比例",
  "Post-trip worker (ratings, email, payment)": "Post-trip worker（評分、email、付款）",
  "PostgreSQL (12 shards, replicas in another AZ)": "PostgreSQL（12 個分片，副本在另一個可用區）",
  "Postgres (trips, the oldest system)": "Postgres（行程，最舊的系統）",
  "Postgres sits almost idle between expirations, then gets hit by a sudden wave the moment a hot key expires.\n\nRequests arriving in that wave have to wait behind everyone else in the same wave. That makes the average wait time long even though average utilization looks low. Short bursts, not the average, determine whether the database holds up.": "沒過期的時候 Postgres 幾乎閒著，但熱門 key 一過期，瞬間就湧進一大波查詢。\n\n這波湧入裡的請求必須排在同波其他請求後面等。所以就算平均使用率看起來很低，平均等待時間還是很長。決定資料庫撐不撐得住的，是瞬間突發，不是平均值。",
  "Postgres stays very quiet. Most requests are reads, and 85% of them stop at the fast Redis cache and never touch the database.\n\nOnly the 15% that miss the cache plus the small share of writes reach Postgres, leaving it with plenty of breathing room.": "Postgres 非常輕鬆。大部分請求都是讀取，其中 85% 在高速的 Redis 快取就直接完成，根本沒碰到資料庫。\n\n只有沒命中快取的 15% 讀取和少數寫入會到 Postgres，所以它留有非常充裕的空間。",
  "Posts primary": "文章主庫",
  "Practice": "練習",
  "Practice problems do not allow a custom service: \"{name}\"": "練習題不能用自訂服務：「{name}」",
  "Pre-warmed instances": "預熱好的實例",
  "Preset name": "樣板名稱",
  "Press \"Run\" to start the simulation.": "按「執行」開始模擬。",
  "Press \"Run\". When the run ends, this tab shows the SLA, the cost, the complexity, and what happened, in time order.": "按「執行」。跑完後，這個分頁依時間順序顯示 SLA、成本、複雜度和發生了什麼。",
  "Press \"Run\". When the run ends, this tab shows the SLA, the cost, the complexity, and what happened, in time order. Only the \"Retry storm\" example has questions and challenges for now; constraint problems, on-call practice and the guess log are under \"Practice\" at the top.": "按「執行」。跑完後，這裡會顯示 SLA、成本、複雜度，並照時間說明發生了什麼。範例的題目和挑戰目前只有「重試風暴」有；限制條件題目、值班練習和先猜紀錄在上方的「練習」。",
  "Press Run. The simulator sends the traffic of the lesson's scenario through the design. You can also press Run in the simulator itself, or jump to the end there.": "按「執行」。模擬器會把這一課情境的流量送進設計。也可以直接在模擬器裡按「執行」，或在那裡跳到結尾。",
  "Press “Find limit” on the run bar. It tests the site at higher and higher traffic until either p99 passes 1 second or errors pass 1%, then reports the ceiling and the component that gave up first.\n\nIs the component it names the same one you picked?": "按執行列上的「找上限」。它會不斷調高流量測試網站，直到 p99 超過 1 秒或錯誤率超過 1%，然後回報上限和最先撐不住的元件。\n\n它點名的元件和你剛剛猜的一樣嗎？",
  "Pressing an elevator call button twice: the elevator still comes only once.": "電梯按鈕按兩次，電梯也只會來一次。",
  "Pressing refresh over and over on a slow ticket site, which adds more traffic and makes the site even slower.": "搶票網站已經很慢還一直按重新整理，結果製造更多流量，讓網站變更慢。",
