  "Push the server to at least 80% busy while keeping p99 under 40 ms and failures under 1%. Do not add servers or slots—slow down Process time step by step until you find the sharp bend (the “knee”) where p99 starts climbing fast.": "把伺服器推到至少 80% 忙碌，同時維持 p99 低於 40 ms、失敗低於 1%。不能增加伺服器或處理槽——請逐步調慢「處理時間」，找出 p99 開始急劇往上衝的轉折點。",
