  "Retries piled up during the spike, but not enough to trap the system forever. It recovered once the queues slowly drained.": "突波期間重試確實累積了一些，但還不足以把系統永遠困住，等佇列慢慢消化完就恢復了。",
  "Retries stop random errors: set 2 retries on API → db and on worker → db. If you fix only the API connection, the background work still loses one job in five.": "偶發的錯誤用重試擋：API → db 和 worker → db 都設 2 次重試。只修 API 那一條，背景工作還是會掉兩成。",
