  "Right. Measured: {m}": "猜對了。實際：{m}",
  "Right@@answer": "猜對了",
  "RocksDB (timeline)": "RocksDB（timeline）",
  "Room for double": "撐住兩倍",
  "Rough ceiling = current traffic ÷ busiest utilization. Headroom is the spare room below that ceiling.": "粗估上限 = 目前流量 ÷ 最忙元件的使用率。餘裕就是離這個上限還剩的空間。",
  "Round robin": "輪流（round robin）",
  "Round robin blindly hands every server the same share, even when one server is backed up.\n\nClick the load balancer and change \"Distribution policy\" to one that checks how busy each server already is (such as \"Least connections\"): a slow server builds a long line, so new requests naturally go to the fast servers. A deep health check alone reacts more slowly because it waits for several probes to fail.": "輪流分配不管誰已經塞車，還是平均發請求給每台伺服器。\n\n點選負載平衡器，把「分配策略」改成會看各台有多忙的方式（例如「最少連線（least connections）」）：慢伺服器排隊一長，新請求自然會改去快伺服器。單靠深度健康檢查反應會慢一點，因為它要等連續幾次檢查失敗才動作。",
  "Round robin keeps sending a slow server its full share, and a liveness check cannot see that it is slow.": "輪流分配會一直把原本的份額送給慢伺服器，而存活檢查看不出它變慢了。",
  "Round robin sends each of the four servers an equal 1/4 share of traffic. Instance 1 is 15 times slower for 60 of the 90 seconds, while the liveness check still sees it as alive. What share of all requests fail?": "輪流分配把流量平均分成四份，每台拿 1/4。整場 90 秒裡，1 號實例有 60 秒變慢 15 倍，而存活檢查仍覺得它活著。全部請求會有多少比例失敗？",
  "Round-robin primary and replica": "主庫和副本輪流",
