  "SQS visibility timeout {visibility} s < function timeout {timeout} s × 6 = {need} s: a message may be delivered again while it is being processed.": "SQS 可見性逾時 {visibility} 秒 < 函式 timeout {timeout} 秒 × 6 = {need} 秒：訊息可能在處理中又被送一次。",
  "SaaS API: a large customer sends 9× the traffic of a small one. The rate limiter gives each user (tenant) its own quota, at most 500 per second and 40 in flight. A large customer over quota only blocks itself; small customers are not affected. Change how the quota is split to one shared quota and watch small customers get blocked too.": "SaaS API：大客戶的流量是小客戶的 9 倍。限流器設成「每個使用者（租戶）各一個額度」，每個租戶每秒最多 500 個，同時處理最多 40 個。大客戶超量只擋大客戶自己，小客戶不受影響。把「額度怎麼分」改成「全部共用一個」，看小客戶一起被擋。",
  "Same as \"Cache stampede\", with two more settings. Lease: when a hot key expires, the first miss gets a lease and reads the DB; the others ask Redis again every 20 ms until the value is written back. Each expiry reads the DB once: DB load drops from about 61 rps to about 23 rps, and nothing fails. TTL jitter 0.2: keys written together at the start do not all expire at second 10, 20 and 30, so DB peaks are lower and more even. The cost: waiting requests take tens of ms longer.": "和「快取擊穿」一樣，只多了兩個設定。Lease：熱門 key 過期時，第一個沒命中的請求拿到 lease 去查 DB，其他的每 20 ms 再問一次 Redis，等它寫回。每次過期只查 DB 一次，DB 從約 61 rps 降到約 23 rps，沒有失敗。TTL jitter 0.2：一開始一起寫入的 key 不會在第 10、20、30 秒一起過期，DB 的尖峰變低、變平均。代價：等待的請求多花幾十 ms。",
  "Same as \"async processing after upload\", but the queue is delete-after-done (like SQS): if a worker fails, the message is not lost and is redelivered after the visibility timeout. 1% are poison messages: after 3 failed receives they move to the DLQ. A message expires if it is not done within 10 minutes.": "和「上傳後非同步處理」一樣，但佇列改成「做完才刪」（像 SQS）：worker 故障時訊息不會遺失，會在 visibility timeout 後重送。1% 是毒訊息，收 3 次還失敗就移到 DLQ。訊息放 10 分鐘還沒做完就過期。",
  "Same as \"retry storm\", plus a retry budget of 0.1: in the last 10 seconds, retries are at most 10% of first calls. API load during a spike drops from about 14× to about 4×, and recovers about 3 s after the spike ends. Deadline propagation alone does not help: each hop timeout (150 ms) is already shorter than the deadline (1 s).": "和「重試風暴」一樣，只多了重試預算 0.1：最近 10 秒內，重試最多是首次呼叫的 10%。突波時 API 負載從約 14 倍降到約 4 倍，突波結束後約 3 秒恢復。只開 deadline 傳遞救不了：每一跳的逾時（150 ms）本來就比 deadline（1 秒）短。",
  "Same as \"retry storm\", with one more setting: every edge uses adaptive throttling (Google SRE, K = 2). The caller counts calls sent and successes over the last 10 s; when too few succeed, it rejects some calls locally and does not send them. After the spike the retry storm stops, and the system recovers after about 33 s. That is slower than the retry budget (about 3 s): the window still holds many failures, and enough successes must build up before all calls are let through. Try K = 1.5 (rejects earlier) or 3.": "和「重試風暴」一樣，只多了一個設定：每條線都開自適應限流（Google SRE 的 adaptive throttling，K = 2）。呼叫端記住最近 10 秒送出幾次、成功幾次；成功太少時，自己在本地擋掉一部分呼叫，不送出去。突波過後重試風暴停下來，系統約 33 秒後恢復。比「重試預算」（約 3 秒）慢：窗口裡記著很多失敗，要累積夠多成功才完全放行。試試把 K 改成 1.5（擋得更早）或 3。",
