  "Scale-out lag = check interval + boot time (plus cold-start warm-up). Help arrives only after both finish.": "擴充延遲 = 偵測間隔＋開機時間（再加上冷啟動暖機）。兩者都走完後，支援才真的到位。",
  "Scale-out lag is the sum of two delays: “Check interval” and “Boot time”.\n\nFast 10–30 s boots alone are not enough if the autoscaler still waits 60 s just to notice the surge. Shorten both settings.": "擴充延遲由兩個等待相加而成：「偵測間隔」和「開機時間」。\n\n如果自動擴充光發現突波就要等 60 秒，單靠 10–30 秒快速開機還是不夠。兩個設定都要縮短。",
