  "See what a healthy, calm simulation run looks like": "先看懂一場健康平穩的模擬長什麼樣子",
  "See why a longer TTL makes bursts rarer, not smaller": "看懂拉長 TTL 只讓湧入變少見、不會變小",
  "See why adding more shards cannot split a single hot key": "看懂增加分片為什麼拆不開單一熱門 key",
