  "Slack style: metastable failure after the cache was emptied (2022-02-22)": "Slack 風格：快取被清空後的 metastable failure（2022-02-22）",
  "Slots available: 4 servers × 32 slots = 128 slots": "現有槽數：4 台伺服器 × 32 個槽 = 128 個槽",
