  "Under these assumptions it holds up to about {holds}/s; at {fail}/s it does not, and {node} goes first.": "在這些假設下，大約撐到 {holds}/秒；{fail}/秒撐不住，最先壞的是 {node}。",
  "Under these assumptions it holds up to {rps} rps; no point where it does not hold was found.": "在這些假設下，到 {rps} rps 都撐得住，沒有找到撐不住的點。",
