  "Upload + async jobs: a slow dependency on the sync path (after Dropbox)": "上傳＋非同步任務：同步路徑上的慢依賴（參考 Dropbox）",
  "Upload API": "上傳 API",
  "Upper limit for autoscaling.": "自動擴充的上限。",
  "Usage: ": "用法：",
  "Use Little’s Law (L = λ × W): long-run average count = arrival rate × long-run average time in that same boundary. Here, 800 requests/s arrive, each takes 2.5 ms (0.0025 s) of active work, plus a tiny queue wait. About how many requests are inside the whole server at once (working plus waiting)?": "套用 Little 定律（L = λ × W）：同一邊界內的長期平均數量 = 到達率 × 該範圍內的長期平均停留時間。這裡每秒進來 800 個請求，每個主動處理花 2.5 ms（0.0025 秒），再加上一點點排隊等待。整個伺服器內（處理中加上排隊中）同時大約有幾個請求？",
  "Use Little’s Law to find how many requests sit inside a server at once": "用 Little 定律算出伺服器裡平均同時有幾個請求",
  "Use a bounded queue to trade long waits for fast rejections": "用有上限的佇列，把漫長等待換成快速拒絕",
  "Use default": "用預設",
  "Use spare headroom when scaling cannot be faster": "在擴充無法更快時，改用餘裕來緩衝",
  "User gives up after": "使用者放棄時間",
  "User spike: 3 × usual requests": "使用者突波：平常請求數的 3 倍",
  "User traffic triples from second 20 to 30, and every failed call retries up to 3 times. After traffic returns to normal at second 30, what happens?": "第 20 到 30 秒使用者流量變 3 倍，且每次失敗最多重試 3 次。第 30 秒流量回到正常之後，會發生什麼事？",
  "Users": "使用者",
  "Users (web, API)": "使用者（網頁、API）",
  "Users already get fast replies, but thumbnails also need to finish quickly. Keep async p99 (the time from entering the queue until the worker finishes) under 1000 ms, even during the spike.\n\nYou may add worker capacity, using at most 10 worker slots in total (machines × slots per machine). Keep users’ p99 under 200 ms.": "使用者已經很快收到回應了，但縮圖也要快點做好。就算遇到尖峰，也要讓「非同步 p99」（從進佇列到 worker 做完的時間）維持在 1000 ms 以下。\n\n你可以增加 worker 容量，但 worker 總槽數最多 10 個（台數 × 每台槽數）。使用者的 p99 要維持在 200 ms 以下。",
  "Users can check out: the payment provider is called to charge them": "使用者能結帳：呼叫金流供應商扣款",
  "Users can place an order; a placed order must not be lost": "使用者能下單；下了單就不能掉",
  "Users can see the stock of a product": "使用者能看到商品的庫存",
  "Users can turn a long URL into a short one": "使用者能把一個長網址換成短網址",
  "Users can view products": "使用者能看商品",
  "Users felt the spike badly because a component on their synchronous path filled up. A message queue protects only the work behind it.": "使用者嚴重感受到尖峰，因為同步路徑上有個元件塞滿了。訊息佇列只能保護在它後面的工作。",
  "Users felt the spike because a component on their synchronous path got busy. Look for a component users wait on directly, not behind the queue.": "使用者感受到尖峰，因為同步路徑上有個元件變忙了。請找使用者直接等待的元件，而不是佇列後面的。",
  "Users go through an API gateway and a load balancer to 8 API servers. At 20 s the scenario deploys a bad config: the new version fails 60% of its requests, and it goes to every gateway and server at once (like Cloudflare's WAF rule in 2019 and its config file push in 2025). The whole site fails together until the end. Try this: in the scenario, set \"Deploy a new version\" to 4 waves, 10 s of watching per wave, and turn on \"Automatic rollback threshold\" at 5%. The first wave updates only a quarter of the machines, and the check rolls it back when it sees failures: only a small share of the requests in those first 10 s are hit (a small blast radius).": "使用者經過 API 閘道和負載平衡器到 8 台 API 伺服器。情境在第 20 秒部署一份壞設定：新版本有 60% 的請求出錯，而且一次推到全部閘道和伺服器（像 2019 年 Cloudflare 的 WAF 規則、2025 年的設定檔推送）。全站一起壞，直到跑完。試試看：在情境裡把「部署新版本」改成 4 波、每波觀察 10 秒，打開「自動回滾門檻」5%。第一波只更新四分之一的機器，觀察期發現失敗就自動回滾：受影響的只有第一波那 10 秒的一小部分請求（爆炸半徑小）。",
  "Users only wait for the Upload API to save the file and drop a ticket in the message queue. That work stays fast during the spike.\n\nThe extra thumbnail jobs pile up inside the queue and wait for the worker. Users do not feel the burst; the background thumbnails absorb it.": "使用者只等 Upload API 存好檔案並把工單丟進訊息佇列。這件事在尖峰期間一樣很快。\n\n多出來的縮圖工作全堆進佇列裡等 worker 處理。使用者感受不到突波，是背景的縮圖工作吸收了它。",
  "Users start to fail ({p} fail in this second)": "使用者開始失敗（這一秒 {p} 失敗）",
  "Users start to fail ({p} fail in this second). The most common reason: {why}": "使用者開始失敗（這一秒 {p} 失敗），最多的原因：{why}",
  "Utilisation": "使用率",
