  "Utilization": "使用率",
  "Utilization (the busiest instance of each component)": "忙碌程度（每個元件最忙的那台）",
  "Utilization = arrival rate ÷ max speed (ρ = λ ÷ (c × μ)). Slower work or fewer slots make a server busier.": "使用率 = 到達率 ÷ 最大速度（ρ = λ ÷ (c × μ)）。處理變慢或槽變少，伺服器就會更忙。",
  "Utilization = arrival rate ÷ max speed. Little’s Law: items inside = arrival rate × time inside.": "使用率 = 到達率 ÷ 最大速度。Little 定律：裡面數量 = 到達率 × 停留時間。",
  "Utilization per instance (hatched: booting; dashed frame: warming up)": "每台實例的忙碌程度（斜線：開機中；虛線框：暖機中）",
  "Utilization ρ": "使用率 ρ",
