  "Very fast temporary memory that stores popular answers so servers do not have to look them up every time.": "速度極快的暫存記憶體，專門記住熱門答案，讓伺服器不用每次都重新查找。",
  "Very few extra calls went out because few reads waited past the hedge delay (either a longer delay, or the load balancer avoided the slow server).": "多送出的呼叫非常少，因為沒幾個讀取等超過對沖等待時間（可能是等待時間較長，或負載平衡器避開了慢伺服器）。",
