  "Waiting 10 seconds, then 20 seconds, then 40 seconds before trying a busy phone line again.": "就像打不通電話時，先等 10 秒、再等 20 秒、再等 40 秒才重撥。",
  "Waiting progressively longer before each retry instead of retrying immediately.": "每次重試前越等越久，而不是馬上連續重試。",
