  "Zero requests fail now, but the bulkhead of 4 is too small! Even at normal 20 ms speed, each API server averages 7.5 recommendation calls in flight at once (375/s × 0.02 s).\n\nBecause the bulkhead caps concurrent calls at 4, many requests get turned away and served the default list even when recommendations are completely healthy. Always size a bulkhead larger than normal concurrency, and use a shorter timeout to cut slow calls short.": "現在完全沒有請求失敗了，但大小為 4 的隔艙太小了！就算在正常的 20 ms 速度下，每台 API 伺服器平均同時就有 7.5 個推薦呼叫在進行（每秒 375 × 0.02 秒）。\n\n因為隔艙把同時呼叫卡在 4 個，連推薦完全健康時也有許多請求被擋下、改給預設清單。隔艙一定要設得比平常的同時呼叫數大，再用較短的逾時切斷慢呼叫。",
